+---
+layout: default
+okf_version: "0.1"
+type: "Technical Justification & Engineering Guide"
+title: "Amazon CloudWatch APM, RUM & Infrastructure Telemetry Architecture Guide"
+timestamp: "2026-08-12T00:00:00+08:00"
