+│                        │ • Memory (mem_used_percent) • Disk Storage • Network I/O      │
+├────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
+│ 4. MANAGED FABRIC      │ Native AWS Telemetry (Free Tier Engine Telemetry)             │
