+| **250,000 sessions** | 2.5M–5M events | **$25.00 – $50.00** ($15.00 – $40.00 in 1st trial mo) | **RM 112.50 – RM 225.00** |
+| **1,000,000 sessions** | 10M–20M events | **$100.00 – $200.00** ($90.00 – $190.00 in 1st trial mo) | **RM 450.00 – RM 900.00** |
