+| **Application Load Balancers** | N/A (L7 Layer) | N/A (L7 Layer) | `ProcessedBytes` / `ActiveConnectionCount` | N/A (HTTP target metrics) | Native Ingress Telemetry | **100% Free** (Standard metrics) |
