+### Financial Sizing: Custom Infrastructure Metrics
+
+* **AWS Pricing:** First 10 custom metrics per account are **Free Tier**; thereafter, **$0.30 USD per metric/month** (verified against AWS pricing for `ap-southeast-5`).
+* **Metric Series Calculation Formula:** Custom network series scale as $4 + 4n$ series per host, where $n$ represents the number of monitored network interfaces.
+* **Single Network Interface Baseline (4 OS + 4 Net = 8 custom metrics/node):** For 15 hosts = 120 series (110 billed after 10 free) = **$33.00 USD / month (~RM 148.50 MYR)**.
+* **Dual Network Interface Baseline (4 OS + 8 Net = 12 custom metrics/node):** For 15 hosts = 180 series (170 billed after 10 free) = **$51.00 USD / month (~RM 229.50 MYR)**.
