+* **Workload Drivers:** 250k–1M web sessions (10–20 RUM events/session = 2.5M–20M events = $25–$200); 5M–20M Application Signals Golden Metrics = $7.50–$30 + optional 10–40 GB traces ($3.50–$14) = $11–$44; 15 EC2 hosts @ 4–12 custom metrics/node across 1–2 interfaces = 60–180 series (50–170 billed @ $0.30) = $15–$51; 10 operational alarms = $5.00.
+
