+**Net Strategic Impact:** Transitioning to native CloudWatch observability delivers full APM and end-user visibility inside **AWS Malaysia (`ap-southeast-5`)** with an immediate recurring operational saving of **~$570.00 to $1,054.00 USD per month (~RM 2,565.00 to RM 4,743.00 MYR per month)**.
